descriptions.job-0vfti8i:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;C0BELK21BLZ-1783052814.278099-thread-list-Thread_1783430418.223099&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The OTC Sales Manager will own the end-to-end sales cycle, from lead generation to relationship management. You will pitch our liquidity solutions, onboard institutional clients, and structure large-volume stablecoin trades. Working closely with our trading desk, compliance teams, and legal experts, you will ensure seamless execution and strict adherence to regulatory standards. Your success will directly impact our trading volume, revenue growth, and market penetration in the digital asset space.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will You Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Business Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Lead the end-to-end sales cycle to expand our institutional footprint and market presence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Source Strategic Accounts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Identify and acquire high-net-worth individuals (HNWIs), market makers, and institutional trading desks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage Liquidity &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Cultivate deep, long-term liquidity relationships and successfully close large-block trades.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Act as the Cross-Functional Liaison:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Serve as the primary bridge between our institutional clients and internal trading, compliance, and product teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OTC/Sales Track Record: 2+ years of experience in institutional sales, financial business development, or OTC trading desks&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crypto Ecosystem Expertise: Deep understanding of stablecoin mechanics (fiat-backed vs. algorithmic/crypto-backed), mint/burn flows, and multi-chain dynamics (Ethereum, Tron, Solana, L2s).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Institutional/HNWI Network: An active, existing network of institutional crypto market participants, funds, or HNWIs is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance-First Mindset: Strong grasp of global AML, KYC, and travel rule requirements. You understand how to manage risk without killing the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional negotiation and presentation skills. You can explain complex settlement flows to other teams clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability: Comfortable navigating an evolving global regulatory landscape for stablecoins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

