&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As OKX scale internationally and navigate an increasingly complex international tax landscape, we are looking for a Global Tax Reporting and Compliance Manager to join our lean, high-impact tax team, partnering closely with Finance, Legal and other stakeholders across the different regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage tax compliance matters for the Group, working with broader finance team and external advisors to ensure timely and accurate filings across all jurisdictions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor tax risks across the Group, maintain documentation of key tax positions, and assist in the assessment of uncertain tax positions for reporting purposes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare quarterly tax provisions and monitor effective tax rate, cash tax positions, identifying drivers for material variances and potential tax risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the implementation and ongoing compliance of Pillar 2 across more than 15 jurisdictions, including deferred tax assessments and filing obligations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor changes and updates in global tax legislation to identify potential tax impacts and provide corresponding tax solutions to business teams in advance, ensuring ongoing tax compliance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business teams to advise on tax implications and support informed decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on controversy matters, working with local finance teams and external advisors to manage the tax audit, submissions, and resolution processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvement initiatives, including enhancement of documentation standards, reporting workflows, and tax-related automation efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with non-tax stakeholders, including Business, Finance, Legal and Product teams to proactively share tax insights and information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other tasks and projects assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvAmdvgIGoKyiHxjBTiu68Kcs9d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of international tax experience, ideally with a mix of Big 4 / advisory and in-house roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent tax accounting and tax compliance technical skills, analytical thinker, detail oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Pillar 2 concepts and Country-by-Country reporting required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter, comfortable operating with ambiguity in a fast-paced, start-up-like environment; resourceful and adaptable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with keen attention to both detail and the bigger picture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity of US/ EU tax concepts and international tax experience supporting US listed MNC highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI and its applications in tax processes is a plus (e.g., leveraging AI for compliance, data analysis, or process automation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CmqsdZ2GTo6Z9VxuHx4ugzRRsm3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt; Benefits &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
