&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Oversee the day-to-day finance operations and end-to-end accounting for assigned entities, covering transaction booking, payment and expense review, and cash monitoring.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the monthly, quarterly and annual financial close, ensuring journal entries, accruals, reconciliations and reporting schedules are completed accurately and on time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prepare and review management accounts, statutory financial statements, Group reporting packages and variance analyses in accordance with IFRS/HKFRS and Group policies.&lt;/div&gt;
