&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEUFd1hvcohl2KxgQFvukeJfsj8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Reconcile bank, exchange, wallet, digital asset, trading and intercompany balances, and coordinate with relevant teams to investigate and resolve discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
