&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PO1QdzAbqoTbbsxZj83lncpMgCg&quot;&gt;An exciting opportunity for an experienced business development professional to lead our&amp;nbsp;commercial activities in NEA.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARJSdwVzjolBWCxEsStlnqISgIe&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for leading our commercial strategy for NEA and driving our growth through partnerships and key client development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HvBoduzl6o50GzxOCAWlvhGVglb&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will need to be highly confident and skilled in speaking to potential clients, regulators, media, and partners.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7OwdD6l0oNET3xDih9l89KKg4f&quot;&gt;As a Commercial Director, you will work with our internal operations, growth, product and marketing teams to achieve the required strategic goals and revenue targets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MdJbdkqkHo76QwxWAMLuN1WHs8d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MdJbdkqkHo76QwxWAMLuN1WHs8d&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusC0ScijlHsAbE8dYk7NUSrd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
